{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「最強CP」林淑敏與許家傑正式加盟節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》，昨日（16日）官方曝光的宣傳片卻驚見二人關係18 …</p><p></p>\n<p>「最強CP」林淑敏與許家傑正式加盟節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》，昨日（16日）官方曝光的宣傳片卻驚見二人關係180度逆轉！影片中兩人隔空互數，火藥味濃，但轉頭竟被發現在暗角激烈擁吻，場面極度震撼，究竟二人關係是龍是鳳？\n</p>\n<h2>慌張西望神還原 許家傑咆哮狂數林淑敏</h2>\n<p>宣傳短片神還原《東張西望》經典採訪模式，不但配上標誌性緊張配樂，更為林淑敏與許家傑的容貌「打格」，營造爆料懸疑感。過往在《愛．回家之開心速遞》中暖男形象深入民心的許家傑，今次化身霸總「宋銳威」竟火力全開，對著鏡頭激動咆哮：「我唔會同佢結婚」、「我嘅底線就係……我最唔鍾意俾人篤魂精㗎喇，大小姐！」句句針對「戴嘉婷」（林淑敏飾），與昔日寵溺「大小姐」的「送水輝」判若兩人。</p>\n<h2>林淑敏大小姐上身反擊 激動狂拋金句</h2>\n<p>面對許家傑的指控，向來霸氣的林淑敏當然不甘示弱，即時連珠炮發反擊，更一度激動得「大小姐」上身：「我姓戴，唔係大小姐呀」、「嗰個婆娘有咩好呀？」她更拋出經典金句，怒斥對方是「人頭豬」，更揚言：「豈有此理」、「我要篤爆佢魂精呀！」雙方因情緒過度激動，訪問需要一度中斷，氣氛極為緊張。\n</p>\n<h2>暗角斷正激烈擁吻 許家傑Man爆護花</h2>\n<p>正當以為兩人勢成水火，攝製隊卻在暗角意外「斷正」二人激烈擁吻！當發現被偷拍，許家傑一秒切換模式，即時Man爆張開雙手為林淑敏擋鏡頭，大叫：「我保護你！」而剛才氣勢逼人的林淑敏則瞬間破功，嚇得「嘩」聲四起，在鏡頭前左閃右避，最後更拋下許家傑，連褸都未穿好便狼狽閃人，前後反差極大，場面非常惹笑。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議反差萌 笑言TVB識玩</h2>\n<p>影片曝光後，網民反應極為熱烈，紛紛對這對CP的新火花表示期待。不少人留言大讚宣傳片有創意：「笑死，慌張西望！TVB好識玩！」、「呢個反差太大了吧！好期待！」、「送水輝變霸總，大小姐都係咁霸氣！」、「終於唔係送水輝同大小姐，有新鮮感！」、「見到佢哋鬧交仲好笑過以前談情！」\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_11141402826afbe1051019a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_11141402826afbe1051019a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_16029829216afbe10a3a86a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_16029829216afbe10a3a86a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_5716231506afbe1114d10b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_5716231506afbe1114d10b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_20250703866afbe12655f92.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_20250703866afbe12655f92.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_17012619616afbe1387fa20.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_17012619616afbe1387fa20.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_4330046446afbe148158d2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_4330046446afbe148158d2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_14266357046afbe14f0ea48.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_14266357046afbe14f0ea48.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_21061575116afbe1541ba5b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_21061575116afbe1541ba5b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_8722436766afbe1584a5d5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_8722436766afbe1584a5d5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_8186102866afbe15c72a9f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_8186102866afbe15c72a9f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22a_14568625066afbe16000a3e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22a_14568625066afbe16000a3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_1647222106afbe16445e6d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之三代同糖 林淑敏 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_1647222106afbe16445e6d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%84%9b%e5%9b%9e%e5%ae%b6%e4%b9%8b%e4%b8%89%e4%bb%a3%e5%90%8c%e7%b3%96/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">愛回家之三代同糖</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9e%97%e6%b7%91%e6%95%8f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">林淑敏</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%a8%b1%e5%ae%b6%e5%82%91/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">許家傑</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544547\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.953826+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1311,"images":12,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T05:30:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:24.378408+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:43:07.057833+00:00","content_hash":"e5d52dfc2a215b640496fe0a7443e36e05075831e213d442bd289788bfbbc819","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}